 "message": "A 12-frame, one-shot shadow blade dance: violet slash arcs flurry in a combo, then cross over each other in an X with sparks, over a dark purple smoke cloud with three small shadow silhouettes flitting in and out. The clones are small and read best at this size; the smoke and the clone silhouettes are the parts to tune if you want them bolder. Note that the clones are pixel silhouettes I drew, not animated fighters, and the palette is four colours per material for the retro look.",
